# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# WHAT DOES NOT WORK HERE, AND WHY THIS FILE IS NEARLY EMPTY
#
# This file used to carry rules like:
#
#     /data/trivia-library.json    /404  404
#
# meaning "serve a 404 for the question bank". It never worked. Cloudflare Pages
# supports 200 (rewrite) and the redirect statuses (301/302/303/307/308) in
# _redirects; a bare 404 status is not honoured, so the rule was silently
# ignored and the whole 41,000-question bank was downloadable by anyone who
# guessed the URL, for as long as that rule had been sitting here looking like
# protection. Verified against production on 18 Aug 2026: the URL returned 200.
#
# A file that IS in the deployed directory will be served. So the only reliable
# way to keep something off the public site is to keep it out of the directory
# Pages deploys.
#
# That is why the schema, both Workers, the seed and maintenance scripts and the
# bulk data files now live in ../venueplay-backend/, a sibling of this folder and
# therefore outside this Pages project. The layout there mirrors this one, so the
# scripts' data paths still resolve.
#
# venueplay/data/ keeps only the three files the site actually fetches at
# runtime: musical-library.json, trivia-count.json and music-count.json.
#
# If you add anything private in future: put it in venueplay-backend/, not here,
# and do not rely on a rule in this file to hide it.
